| fixture.rb:14:9:14:23 | call to attributes | This call reads `.attributes` (local-name-keyed hash) without a corresponding `.attribute_nodes` check; namespaced attributes such as `xlink:href` are invisible to this accessor and may carry dangerous values (e.g. `javascript:` URLs) through sanitisation. Add `attribute_nodes.each { \|a\| a.remove if a.namespace }` before processing attributes. |
